    "text": "He settles between your thighs and the first slow push has you both going quiet. 'There,' he says, like a rep logged. He moves the way he does everything — counted, controlled, every stroke deliberate until control is the thing that breaks. 'Good girl, that's it, you take it so well.' You're past speech. When he comes it's deep and he holds there, buried, letting you feel it flood warm. 'One,' he murmurs. And you know, even wrecked, exactly whose this is — kept warm in you, carried home, saved for the man who'll want the number.",
